Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Most AI wearables only record
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,when you tell them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A meeting, a lecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.49,0:00:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,or a voice memo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but the moments that matter the most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,aren’t the ones that you think to record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We think true understanding requires
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the context of your entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just one meeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.57,0:00:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but how your days actually go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who lifts you up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and what you keep putting off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s wali.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a pendant that listens to your life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and helps you live it a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The pendant records all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,even with your phone in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you open the app,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,everything syncs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In the cloud, every recording is transcribed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and every speaker is labeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Every voice gets a fingerprint,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,so if you label a friend once,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,wali knows them for every conversation later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Several times a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,a fast decision model reads my latest conversation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and decides if anything needs action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, nothing does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But when something does, it routes to an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.25,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That agent connects to thousands of apps through Composio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:00:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For anything without an integration,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.45,0:01:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,like Canvas, it uses its own cloud browser.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And since this weekend’s theme is ‘Let’s dig in,’
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.15,0:01:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you can chat with your whole life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,on your phone or on the web.
